  --leave-type: list<int> # Select which `leaveType` will be returned. Based on the provided 'leaveType.key'(s) If not provided, the `leaveType` 16 (Verlof) is returned (16 is the sum of leaveType 1 (bovenwettelijk verlof) and 15 (wettelijk verlof))
